'''Walio''' is a [[Sepik language]] spoken in [[East Sepik Province]], [[Papua-New Guinea]]. It is spoken in Walio village ({{coord|-4.409276|142.227361|type:city_region:PG|name=Walio}}) of [[Tunap/Hunstein Rural LLG]] in [[East Sepik Province]].

